<title>USA: Upper Twp BOE, N.J., won by PNC Capital Markets.</title>
<headline>Upper Twp BOE, N.J., won by PNC Capital Markets.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>PNC Capital Markets said it won $3.589 million of Upper Township Board of Education, N.J., school bonds, with a lowest rate of 4.70, highest price of 100.076.</p>
</text>
